{"type":"lesson.started","request_id":"83923058-ec1c-4a4d-97ce-50d3a0998b3c","title":"Superposition of two waves: constructive and destructive"}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"83923058-ec1c-4a4d-97ce-50d3a0998b3c","step":{"id":"s1","script":"Superposition means adding displacements at each position. Start with the same unit-amplitude wave in both panels.","ops":[{"op":"axes","id":"sameaxes","region":"left","x":{"min":0,"max":6.2832,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-2.5,"max":2.5,"label":"displacement"}},{"op":"curve","id":"waveleft","axes_id":"sameaxes","expr":"sin(x)","domain":[0,6.2832]},{"op":"axes","id":"oppaxes","region":"right","x":{"min":0,"max":6.2832,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-2.5,"max":2.5,"label":"displacement"}},{"op":"curve","id":"waveright","axes_id":"oppaxes","expr":"sin(x)","domain":[0,6.2832]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"83923058-ec1c-4a4d-97ce-50d3a0998b3c","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Left: an identical wave aligns crest with crest. Right: an inverted wave aligns crest with trough. Add their signed displacements, not their heights.","ops":[{"op":"curve","id":"samewave","axes_id":"sameaxes","expr":"sin(x)","domain":[0,6.2832]},{"op":"equation","id":"sameeq","anchor":{"el":"sameaxes","side":"below","gap":0.04},"latex":"y_1=\\sin x,\\quad y_2=\\sin x"},{"op":"curve","id":"oppwave","axes_id":"oppaxes","expr":"-sin(x)","domain":[0,6.2832]},{"op":"equation","id":"oppeq","anchor":{"el":"oppaxes","side":"below","gap":0.04},"latex":"y_1=\\sin x,\\quad y_2=-\\sin x"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Where the first wave has displacement +1, what is the total displacement in each panel?","expected_gist":"Left: +2. Right: 0."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"83923058-ec1c-4a4d-97ce-50d3a0998b3c","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Constructive interference doubles the amplitude here. Destructive interference cancels it completely because the waves have equal amplitudes and opposite displacements everywhere.","ops":[{"op":"curve","id":"sumleft","axes_id":"sameaxes","expr":"2*sin(x)","domain":[0,6.2832]},{"op":"equation","id":"constructive","anchor":{"el":"sameeq","side":"below","gap":0.04},"latex":"\\text{Constructive: }y=y_1+y_2=2\\sin x"},{"op":"curve","id":"sumright","axes_id":"oppaxes","expr":"0","domain":[0,6.2832]},{"op":"equation","id":"destructive","anchor":{"el":"oppeq","side":"below","gap":0.04},"latex":"\\text{Destructive: }y=y_1+y_2=0"}],"checkpoint":null}}
